// Application-level settings for the Runner target.
//
// This may be replaced with something auto-generated from metadata (e.g., pubspec.yaml) in the
// future. If not, the values below would default to using the project name when this becomes a
// 'flutter create' template.

// The application's name (PRODUCT_NAME) and bundle identifier
// (PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER) come from app/Identity.xcconfig through the
// flavor xcconfigs. Do not set them here: this file is the target-level base
// and would override them.

// The copyright shown in the About panel. Edit it in app/Identity.xcconfig.
PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT = $(IDENTITY_MACOS_COPYRIGHT)
